WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.920
A positive statement commonly takes a negative question tag; a negative statement

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:06.493
takes a positive tag.

00:00:07.367 --> 00:00:10.204
Complete: “She is here, blank ?” Answer: isn't she

00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:15.335
Have a partner turn five statements into polite confirmation questions.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:19.293
Discuss why: A positive 'is' statement takes 'isn't she?'.
